{"unit_id":"realchenwenqiao__dash#card-zh","repo":"realchenwenqiao/dash","commit":"dcf33463413736e9cd5db14f6c790e00734a87f3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DASH 是 DeepSeek Harness 的全屏终端界面插件，通过 Cordis bundle 接入 dsh，并以 pi-tui 展示 Markdown 对话、工具活动和状态。用户可在会话中切换模型、保存 provider 凭据、恢复或新建会话、导出 Markdown，也可从行为记录回滚并创建分支。界面还支持折叠推理和工具输出、切换 plan 模式及文件路径补全，适合在终端或 SSH 中使用 DSH agent。需要 Node.js 22 以上和已配置的 DSH provider。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-28","src/index.ts:614-710","src/index.ts:1000-1120","src/index.ts:1200-1280"]}
{"unit_id":"realchenwenqiao__dash#card-en","repo":"realchenwenqiao/dash","commit":"dcf33463413736e9cd5db14f6c790e00734a87f3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DASH is a full-screen terminal interface for DeepSeek Harness. It displays conversations and tool activity, and supports model switching, session resume, Markdown export, and rewind branching. It also collapses reasoning and tool output. Requires Node.js 22+ and a configured DSH provider.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-28","src/index.ts:614-710","src/index.ts:1000-1120","src/index.ts:1200-1280"]}
